    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Way of the Dragons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a challenging parkour adventure filled with tricks and traps to mess with your friends. When they breathe fire at you, don\u2019t forget to run or you\u2019ll be stunned for a while!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/dd7858e191042f7d33d6dbe8bc615975.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/dd7858e191042f7d33d6dbe8bc615975.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/dd7858e191042f7d33d6dbe8bc615975.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Alert</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, your friends can grab and throw you off at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/020b7acfe0b8c61c0a6931a931ef1a50.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/020b7acfe0b8c61c0a6931a931ef1a50.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/020b7acfe0b8c61c0a6931a931ef1a50.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/ba20e8d60d50aeb4c44b149f40ac947c.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/ba20e8d60d50aeb4c44b149f40ac947c.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/ba20e8d60d50aeb4c44b149f40ac947c.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Patience is a Virtue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if the parkour feels tough, just have fun. After all, it\u2019s just a game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/c40ed49b1dc72a8e46e5a3f017be8e34.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/c40ed49b1dc72a8e46e5a3f017be8e34.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/c40ed49b1dc72a8e46e5a3f017be8e34.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Needs a Timer to Fly?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you\u2019re playing as a baby dragon, don\u2019t try to fly before your stamina bar is full or you\u2019ll probably fall and have to grab onto whatever you can!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Way of the Dragons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a challenging parkour adventure filled with tricks and traps to mess with your friends. When they breathe fire at you, don\u2019t forget to run or you\u2019ll be stunned for a while!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/dd7858e191042f7d33d6dbe8bc615975.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/dd7858e191042f7d33d6dbe8bc615975.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/dd7858e191042f7d33d6dbe8bc615975.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Alert</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, your friends can grab and throw you off at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/020b7acfe0b8c61c0a6931a931ef1a50.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/020b7acfe0b8c61c0a6931a931ef1a50.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/020b7acfe0b8c61c0a6931a931ef1a50.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/ba20e8d60d50aeb4c44b149f40ac947c.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/ba20e8d60d50aeb4c44b149f40ac947c.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/ba20e8d60d50aeb4c44b149f40ac947c.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Patience is a Virtue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if the parkour feels tough, just have fun. After all, it\u2019s just a game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/c40ed49b1dc72a8e46e5a3f017be8e34.poster.avif?t=1752600101\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/c40ed49b1dc72a8e46e5a3f017be8e34.webm?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656190/extras/c40ed49b1dc72a8e46e5a3f017be8e34.mp4?t=1752600101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Needs a Timer to Fly?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you\u2019re playing as a baby dragon, don\u2019t try to fly before your stamina bar is full or you\u2019ll probably fall and have to grab onto whatever you can!</p>",
    "short_description": "Join the journey of baby dragons who\u2019ve fallen from their nests, climbing back up to find their mothers in a chaotic parkour adventure. Burning or tossing each other off ledges might be fun but don\u2019t let them forget why they\u2019re climbing. Their mothers are waiting above\u2026 or are they?",
